# No ADRs in public docs

ADRs live in `docs/decisions/` for agents and maintainers. Public `/docs` and npm READMEs do not link to them.

## Do

- State the rule in the page (query-only, providers vs drivers)
- Link other `/docs` pages, `/security`, or https://db-sdk.dev

## Do not

- Link `docs/decisions/*` or GitHub ADR blobs
- Write “See ADR 0003” / “ADR 0002” in Related lists
- Use ADR numbers as the reader’s next step

```mdx
<!-- Bad -->
See [ADR 0003](https://github.com/becausify/db-sdk/blob/main/docs/decisions/0003-providers-and-drivers.md).

<!-- Good -->
See [Postgres](/docs/postgres).
```
